{"version":1,"content":"<p>在人類邁向更大規模太空基礎設施建設的道路上，一項重要裏程碑近日誕生。由美國加州理工學院研發、美國國防高級研究計劃局（DARPA）資助的一台機械人，成功在軌道上完成結構組裝任務，被研究團隊稱為人類首次實現太空中的自主結構建造。</p> <a href=\"https://www.cnbeta.com.tw/articles/science/1585694.htm\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\"><strong>閲讀全文</strong></a>","scraped_at":"2026-11-10T12:20:23.163241+00:00","quality":{"score":0,"chars":117,"images":0,"source":"cnBeta","fallback":"rss-budget","origin":"rss","completeness":"unverified"},"published_at":"2026-11-10T05:41:08+00:00","fetched_at":"2026-11-10T12:13:47.084728+00:00","content_updated_at":"2026-11-10T12:13:47.084728+00:00","content_hash":"23818934b15ceb633f370717494f2d8a88ccb9e926a817b8b29198bda1190c9d","evidence_status":"partial","scrape_error":null,"content_retention":null,"content_capture":null}